  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NHC- Advocates for Change: T&#xfc;rkiye Civil Society Program 2024/2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to build capacity of small society organizations in Turkey, including mentorship. The focus areas are protection of human rights, democratic principals, and the rule of law. More concreately, this includes focusing on human rights defenders, freedom of expression and the media, LGBTQIA+, gender equality and women empowerement. The project aims at reaching organizations outside of the big cities of Ankara, Istanbul and Izmir.</narrative>
  </description>
